Package: usbguard-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Antigravity Assistant <support@example.com>
Installed-Size: 120
Depends: usbguard, python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-notify-0.7, libnotify-bin, pkexec
Recommends: usbguard-notifier
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://usbguard.github.io/
Description: USB Guard - USB device authorization and BadUSB protection manager
 A graphical management tool and background monitor for USBGuard.
 Blocks newly plugged-in USB devices by default to protect against BadUSB
 and malicious hardware, while allowing users to easily trust, authorize,
 and whitelist legitimate USB devices with one click.
